# (python-pyqt5 removed: zohara-welcome and zohara-migrate are Rust/GTK now,
# and account/update management lives in Zohara Settings.)
gtk4
libadwaita

# Office, Media & Productivity
libreoffice-fresh
gwenview
haruna
ark
# Ark (above) has no format backends without these: .zip and .7z --
# formats any Windows-habituated user downloads constantly -- silently
# fail to open otherwise. (.rar needs unrar, which isn't in the official
# repos; left out rather than reaching for an unofficial source.)
p7zip
unzip
okular
kate

# System Utilities, Power & Monitors
usbutils
pciutils
power-profiles-daemon
# Battery/AC status for Plasma's system tray icon (PowerDevil/plasma-nm
# queries this over D-Bus). Not pulled in by anything else -- confirmed
# missing on real hardware (Dell Latitude): the tray showed no battery
# icon at all, plugged in or not, on the 2026-09-28 live ISO.
upower
# v4l2-ctl (Settings > Bluetooth & devices > Cameras list calls this
# directly, bluetooth.rs:249) -- without it, that list silently shows no
# cameras even when one exists.
v4l-utils
bluedevil
plasma-systemmonitor
# ufw is the firewall; Zohara Settings (Privacy & security) is its front-end. plasma-firewall (KDE's own front-end) is not
# installed on purpose: it showed a second, duplicate "Firewall" in the Start menu search.
ufw
btop
grim
slurp
# Firmware updates (BIOS, SSD, peripherals) via fwupdmgr. Real hardware
# ships firmware fixes through this; nothing else pulls it in.
fwupd

# KDE Wallet & Online Services Fixes
kwallet
kwalletmanager
kwallet-pam
ca-certificates
attica
knewstuff

